<h2>Asobi Review 1.0 (build 1728) <span class="when">Oct 20, 2026</span></h2>
<ul>
<li><b>Recording a session</b> no longer turns the call and the clip audio down on your Mac while it records.</li>
</ul>
<hr>
<div class="earlier">Earlier updates</div>
<h3>1.0 (build 1724) <span class="when">Oct 19, 2026</span></h3>
<ul>
<li><b>Shots added during a review</b> come into your playlist on their own, without rejoining, and you follow the host to them.</li>
</ul>
<h3>1.0 (build 1711) <span class="when">Oct 19, 2026</span></h3>
<ul>
<li>Improvements and fixes.</li>
</ul>
<h3>1.0 (build 1708) <span class="when">Oct 19, 2026</span></h3>
<ul>
<li>Improvements and fixes.</li>
</ul>
<h3>1.0 (build 1705) <span class="when">Oct 19, 2026</span></h3>
<ul>
<li>Improvements and fixes.</li>
</ul>
<h3>1.0 (build 1698) <span class="when">Oct 19, 2026</span></h3>
<ul>
<li><b>Joining a review brings in every clip.</b> A Mac that joins while the host is in the review gets the whole playlist, in the host&#8217;s order, not just the clip the host is on. Clips this Mac doesn&#8217;t have play as the review&#8217;s copies.</li>
</ul>
<h3>1.0 (build 1695) <span class="when">Oct 19, 2026</span></h3>
<ul>
<li>Improvements and fixes.</li>
</ul>
<h3>1.0 (build 1476) <span class="when">Oct 12, 2026</span></h3>
<ul>
<li><b>DPX sequences play.</b> 8, 10, 12 and 16-bit DPX files open and play like any other image sequence, read as the color space set for DPX in Settings, Color.</li>
<li>A tall floating Playlist with thumbnails could stop the app. Fixed.</li>
<li>Small fixes.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
